OL,3,ARival protests in Portsmouth as face
OL,4,Amasks banned
OL,5,
OL,6,FRival groups of protesters have marched
OL,7,Fthrough Portsmouth as police
OL,8,Frestrictions on the use of masks and
OL,9,Fbalaclavas came into effect.
OL,11,FHampshire and Isle of Wight
OL,12,FConstabulary said on Friday it would
OL,13,Fuse new powers under the Crime and
OL,14,FPolicing Act to prevent people involved
OL,15,Fin protest activity from wearing face
OL,16,Fcoverings that conceal their identity.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
