OL,3,ARival protests in Portsmouth as face
OL,4,Amasks banned
OL,5,
OL,6,FA large police presence could be seen
OL,7,Fin the city centre, where anti-migrant
OL,8,Fprotesters assembled, while rival
OL,9,Fdemonstrators holding Stand up to
OL,10,FRacism banners began a march shortly
OL,11,Fafterwards.
OL,13,FThe measures came into effect at 10:00
OL,14,FBST. Participants on both sides were
OL,15,Fnot seen to be wearing any face
OL,16,Fcoverings when the marches started.
